n \n \n 本日届いたお花を紹介します🌻\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3C0MGGN0VXZED3ECWRV29","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3C1NZ7115EK6S7TFGKNR7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3C2QMK9CMBN0YEEHC6NRN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 可愛いお花をたくさんありがとうございました＼(^o^)／🌟🌟\n \n \n \n 改めて、本日お越しくださまたみなさんありがとうございました！\n \n 応援してくださる皆さんがいるから自分は頑張れるんだなーとひしひしと思う1日でした！\n 皆さん今日はしっかり寝てください😴\n そして明日からまた一緒に頑張りましょう。！\n \n おやすみなさい💤\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3C4B287ZP3E1EFQZ4XNWJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました(・ω・)\n \n としちゃん"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-57994":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんにちは！\n鳥取県出身 20歳\n山口陽世（やまぐちはるよ）です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い！\nみんな体調気を付けてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなあいで(少し遅めの)成人企画をしていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20年間いろいろありましたね〜\n今に繋がっているものもあったりして面白かったです\nみんなの昔のことも知れて楽しかったですね\nあとはいろいろ学ばなきゃですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひまだ観てない方は観てみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://lemino.docomo.ne.jp/contents/Y3JpZDovL3BsYWxhLmlwdHZmLmpwL3ZvZC8wMDAwMDAwMDAwXzAwbTJ0dmU3aTM=?pit_git_type=PIT"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6V8GQJVVN93Z0H7NXFQ61S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nめがねめがね\nまた今度めがね買いに行く約束した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6V8HSRP93CW412GETG6A3Z","alt"